UgwJ89QzyPWg8tY1UJp4AaABAg,,False,@Mirzeli13,"I don't know if I'm getting more sensitive the older I get, but turning 40 a month ago has me feeling extra sensitive. Sugas show is so heartwarming, wholesome, and full of wise advice from both the host and the invitee. I love the questions Suga asks the artists. They're profound and make you feel as if you are not alone in the feelings and thoughts you have when struggling. I love that they mentioned how people are not always on a black or white side, but there's a gray area in the in-between with no extreme opinion. I just look forward to Suga's show as I learn from each episode about how people cope with hardships, and it makes these artists more relatable! Hope Suga keeps this going for 40 years!!!!",419,2023-02-24T22:25:32Z,2023-02-24T22:25:32Z
