Ugwqu99p_sp5_1BqQYl4AaABAg,,False,@KatieGeorgieva,"How did Korean music go from Eric High to SNAD and EXO? How? How did Korean society go from quality music to mediocre music? I personally would like to find out what caused this change (definitely for the worse).  The same thing happened in my country in the late 1990s and early 2000s, the reason being political - outside circles decided that if they imposed a more mediocre and downright vulgar style of music for mass listening it would make society easier to manipulate. So the dominant music becomes folk (a style full of mediocre lyrics, bad music and vulgar behavior and looks with a lot of plastic surgery), and all normal music (and a club even for that music) is destroyed. After 20 years, the normal industry is practically destroyed, and if you want to listen to something normal, then the songs are only foreign. I wonder if something similar has happened in Korea!?🧐",0,2023-02-23T13:55:48Z,2023-02-23T13:58:06Z
